
## Gate tests

Each file below is a gate test: a `tests/integration/test_*_gate.py` file that
`make test`, and so `make verify`, collects. `tests/integration/test_reference_drift.py`
`gate_tests` derives the set from that file name, so a new gate test fails the
reference-drift test until it has a row here.

| Feature | What it does and why | How to run | Settings | Limits / not for | Deep doc | Ships |
|---------|----------------------|------------|----------|------------------|----------|-------|
